    "PostgreSQL 响应超时，连接已断开。写入可能已完成，请重新连接并核对数据，勿直接重复提交。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PostgreSQL timed out and disconnected. The write may have completed. Reconnect and check your data before submitting again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PostgreSQL 响应超时，连接已断开。写入可能已完成，请重新连接并核对数据，勿直接重复提交。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
