    "MongoDB 没有声明式外键；此处展示集合定义、验证器声明字段和索引，不推断文档间关联。定义导出为 JSON。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MongoDB has no declarative foreign keys. Collection definitions, validator fields and indexes are shown without inferring relationships. Definitions export as JSON."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MongoDB 没有声明式外键；此处展示集合定义、验证器声明字段和索引，不推断文档间关联。定义导出为 JSON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SQLite 原始建表/视图定义包含 CHECK、复合约束及生成列表达式；筛选标签仅标记已读取的字段约束。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original SQLite table/view definitions include CHECK constraints, composite constraints and generated expressions. Filter tags reflect retrieved field constraints."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SQLite 原始建表/视图定义包含 CHECK、复合约束及生成列表达式；筛选标签仅标记已读取的字段约束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PostgreSQL 目录元数据；UNIQUE MEMBER 表示参与唯一约束，复合约束不保证单列唯一。DDL 为结构参考，完整迁移请使用 pg_dump。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PostgreSQL catalog metadata. UNIQUE MEMBER means participation in a unique constraint; composite constraints do not imply single-column uniqueness. DDL is a structural reference; use pg_dump for complete migration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PostgreSQL 目录元数据；UNIQUE MEMBER 表示参与唯一约束，复合约束不保证单列唯一。DDL 为结构参考，完整迁移请使用 pg_dump。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
